## Facility Rentals

- **60 Min - Weekday (Mon to Thurs):** $2,000 *(Note: Exclusive access to entire facility)*
- **60 Min - Weekend (Fri to Sun):** $3,000 *(Note: Exclusive access to entire facility)*
- **Facility Capacity:** Up to 220 jumpers *(Note: Private access with dedicated staff on-site)*
- **Included:** Jump socks, all party rooms, tablecloths, cutlery *(Note: Food and catering at additional cost)*
